# ==============================================================
# ElevenLabs API Configuration Example
# ==============================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Create a free account at https://elevenlabs.io
# 2. Go to your Profile settings -> API Keys
# 3. Copy your API Key
# 4. Copy this file and rename it to ".env" (without .example)
# 5. Paste your real key below:
# ==============================================================

ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_actual_elevenlabs_api_key_here
